<section style="padding-top:56px; padding-bottom:72px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
    <p class="eyebrow">For businesses</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);">Get your business featured</h1>
    <div class="page-body" style="line-height:1.75; font-size:1.02rem;">
      <p>Travel Antalya is an independent guide to Antalya’s hotels, restaurants, golf clubs, beaches and sights. Businesses can ask for a <strong>Featured listing</strong> to reach people who are planning a trip.</p>
      <h2>What a featured listing includes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Top placement</strong> in its list (hotels, restaurants or golf), above the alphabetical order.</li>
        <li>A <strong>“Featured” label</strong> on the card and page, so visitors always know it is a paid placement.</li>
        <li>A <strong>gold star and exact pin</strong> on our <a href="/map/">interactive map</a>, with a link to your page.</li>
        <li>Your own booking or reservation link, and the photos you give us permission to use.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What stays the same</h2>
      <p>Featured placements never change our descriptions or the facts we verify, and we do not accept payment for reviews or ratings. Details are in our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> and <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
      <h2>How to start</h2>
      <p>Send us the name of your business, its official website and the area. We reply with the available placements and rates. <a class="btn btn-orange" href="/contact/">Contact us</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
